From b40c2385ca5f84895a1ad5ac75e95b23f98fba62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philip Mueller <claude@philipmueller.ch>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:57:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 45/45] feat(harbor_agent): OpenCode install from an archive
 uploaded by the adapter

opencode_install: upload takes the release archive from opencode_archive_dir/<version>/<asset>
on the node (fetched once per run), checks its sha256 once per process, uploads it into each
sandbox and runs the same install script with the download skipped. The sandbox then needs
neither internet nor python3, curl or wget, only tar; the uploaded archive is removed after the
install (sandbox files live in node memory on diskless nodes). binary (download in the pod)
stays the default.

Signed-off-by: Philip Mueller <claude@philipmueller.ch>
